  "prefLabel": "Plc 1602.06 Investigator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1602.06 “Investigator” means an individual authorized by the executive director to conduct an investigation into allegations of potential violations by a licensee of applicable provisions in RSA 326-M or Plc 1600, or both.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
